OL,3,GNEWSAEx-detective loses #344k claim
OL,4,Aafter former fiancee marries officer
OL,5,Awho handled affair complaint
OL,6,
OL,7,FA former detective has lost his case
OL,8,Fagainst a police force over the
OL,9,Fhandling of his complaint after his
OL,10,Ffiancee cheated on him with a colleague
OL,11,Fand later married the senior officer
OL,12,Fwho investigated the affair.
OL,14,FAndrew Fearon split up with his
OL,15,Fpartner, who was also a police officer,
OL,16,Fin 2017 after she had an affair with
OL,17,Fanother officer and he lodged a
OL,18,Fgrievance.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
