OL,3,GNEWSAEx-detective loses #344k claim
OL,4,Aafter former fiancee marries officer
OL,5,Awho handled affair complaint
OL,6,
OL,7,FHis ex-fiancee later married the
OL,8,Fgrievance manager who looked into the
OL,9,Fcomplaint, but a judge said there was
OL,10,Fno evidence they got together until
OL,11,Flong after the investigations.
OL,13,FFearon told the court he was left with
OL,14,Fcomplex post-traumatic stress disorder
OL,15,F(PTSD), but the judge disagreed North
OL,16,FWales Police (NWP) was to blame.
